DOMAIN,st.dl.eccdnx.com
DOMAIN,st.dl.pinyuncloud.com
DOMAIN,steampipe.steamcontent.tnkjmec.com
DOMAIN,steampowered.com.8686c.com
DOMAIN,steamstatic.com.8686c.com
DOMAIN,xz.pphimalayanrt.com

# 完美世界（CS2 / Dota 2 国服）
